sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Cl as Client
    participant Ed as Edge node
    participant Loc as Local bucket
    participant Ct as Quota service
    Cl->>Ed: request
    Ed->>Loc: spend a token locally
    alt local lease has tokens
        Loc-->>Ed: allowed — no network hop on the hot path
        Ed-->>Cl: served
    else lease exhausted
        Ed->>Ct: request a larger lease
        alt global quota remains
            Ct-->>Loc: new lease
            Ed-->>Cl: served
        else over quota
            Ct-->>Ed: denied
            Ed-->>Cl: 429 with Retry-After
        end
    end
    Note over Loc,Ct: leases trade a little over-admission for not consulting a global counter per request
